 incident INC-0001 exists and is open. I confirmed it before retrying, so there is only one. It describes the failure, the rollback, and the partial-failure event.\n\nFollow-up for the team: investigate why v2.3.1 failed and why the rollout halted partway. Don't re-release v2.3.1 until that is understood.", "type": "text"}]}]}